{520}{Timber wagons, mostly. I started handing tools to a man who could no longer get beneath his own carts. Then he started handing them to me. I learned to notice what was wearing loose before it broke.}{Timber wagons, mostly. I started handing tools to a man who could no longer get beneath his own carts. Then he started handing them to me. I learned to notice what was wearing loose before it broke.}{}{}{0}{ }
